License testing is enabled as well.

QA Questions:
- If the game has Interstitials, what is the starting point of it and what is the frequency?
*We don’t have interstitials at the moment.*
- How many levels / how much content does the game have?
*The game has  ~4800 levels (160 chapters with each chapter having 30 levels except the first 6 chapters) + mini-games quests and tons of live ops. I recommend QA to play until Chapter 3 Level 10 where we unlock the last available character and let them play the last big new feature intro.*
- Does the game have Rate Me? If yes what is the popup point for it?
• *Yes, the game has multiple rate me pop ups. If they skip, we ask them again in the next chapter. If they say yes, we don’t show the subsequent pop-ups anymore. They show up after player completes 2-7, 3-15, 4-15, 5-15, 7-15*
- Does the game have notifications? If yes what are the conditions for it?
*Yes, the game has notifications.  Conditions for all notifications can be found here under “PNs Beta” tab: <https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1zIF-neTBpDnQuS9G-Ti4kx95zypnuGZY7LkW80I6gZI/edit?gid=853710202#gid=853710202>*
- Does the game have a cloud save system?
*Yes, it does.*
- What are the version and build numbers of the shared Live version/APK/Internal Testing/Test Flight build?
*IOS 03.205, Android 0.3.267 - Note that these have economy changes but do not have Boombit integration yet. We’ll give the boombit build numbers when we merge the boombit branch with the economy changes branch.*

Last but not least, I think <@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> has a ticket regarding boombit integration and needs help: ticket ID is #TDEV00000842", "channel": "C09SWTHEMEW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "thread_ts": "1765751525.848839", "subtype": "thread_broadcast"}, {"ts": "1765933143.608699", "type": "message", "text": "*Fresh way to jump into levels:* Lives are out, now you can enter using *1 Ticket* or *1,000 Coins*. Got a timed *Unlimited Ticket*? Play freely while it’s active.
