3. Was the quests spreadsheet updated?", "channel": "C9CA62B5180A", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1764964418.909659", "type": "message", "text": "Along with the ticket system, we nerfed the win streak system which has been historically too strong and overpowering the streak holders. Instead of
1 consecutive win - 1 extra tile at start
2 consecutive wins - 2 extra tiles at start
3 consecutive wins - 2 extra tiles and 1 wild tile at hand at start

we will have

1 consecutive win - 100 coins at start (effectively ~10% discount on level cost, depending on what type of level difficulty the level has (i.e. normal, hard, epic))
2 consecutive wins - 1 extra tile at start
3 consecutive wins - 2 extra tiles at start

We also decreased the amount of early assistance, boosting chance of players to pull a relevant card from the deck

In addition, live ops now drops less pre-level and in-level boosters as rewards but give more tickets and stars to help managing the new coin balancing of the game and making characters upgrades a bit easier from star economy perspective.

The final big change in terms of economy is character upgrades now use gems instead of coins, saving players from the confusion of where to spend their coins on. Coins are the main currency driving level progression while character progression is gonna feel more premium and players may need to go for IAPs if they want to accelerate their character progression or slow burn through live events and do their quests.

We’ll share the build once we are ready to ship.", "channel": "C09SWTHEMEW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1764963892.192309", "type": "message", "text": "Happy Friday. Quick update on DD: Blake is still working on the SDK implementation - it looks like we need a few more biz days to finish the implementation but we are getting There. We have finished feature implementation of the ticket system which will be replacing “lives” system. We are fixing bugs and need to test the backend changes. If all goes well we expect to have everything good to go on our end by mid next week.", "channel": "C09SWTHEMEW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1764886633.228919", "type": "message", "text": "Pushed my PreLevelUI updates, but still adding/subtracting tickets is not working, the profile does not have the new fields for tickets, so trying to update profile create an error. Blake is going to debug server side so I'll keep you posted.", "channel": "D07E9PSQB6W", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0021_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1764659626.614679", "type": "message", "text": "Hello. I wanted to give a quick update of where we are. We are QAing changes that we had to make due to moving the game to Unity 6. Things are looking good and we expect to wrap those up in the next day or so. <@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> is working on SDK implementation and told me that the SDK is causing some issues regarding Singular, our default attribution provider vs appsflyer. He may have some questions for the team tomorrow. 

We are also working on making some serious economy changes to help the game generate a healthy negative coin flow. We are removing lives feature from the game and replacing it with a ticket system similar to Domino Dreams.  There are some other changes such as nerfing win streak rewards, giving out less boosts but more tickets etc. I will share the spec when we finalize it. ", "channel": "C09SWTHEMEW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "thread_ts": "1764659626.614679"}, {"ts": "1764181698.125539", "type": "message", "text": "Standalone should be installed on the CI/CD machine, also it seems like you're entering the dev mode? Can you please create the support ticket through [USERNAME_3766]? I believe my support developers will be able to guide you through the setup faster :blush:", "channel": "C09SWTHEMEW", "user": "PERSON_6037_SLACK_ID", "thread_ts": "1763988247.767269"}, {"ts": "1763988830.240059", "type": "message", "text": "Hey <@EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID> I’ll add the core license and the required documents here so that everything stays in one place

